":"For advance bookings, the following information is required: name, phone number, pickup address, destination, date and time."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-semibold text-white","children":"4. Prices and Payment"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm","children":"Prices are based on the distance traveled, time of day and special requirements. For advance bookings, a fixed price can be agreed upon on request."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm mt-2","children":"Accepted payment methods: Cash, credit cards (Visa, Mastercard), debit cards, Twint. Corporate clients can pay by invoice (by arrangement)."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-semibold text-white","children":"5. Cancellation and Changes"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm","children":"Bookings can be cancelled free of charge up to 2 hours before the scheduled pickup time. For later cancellations or no-shows, a cancellation fee may be charged."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm mt-2","children":"Changes to the booking (e.g. time, address) will be accommodated where possible and should be communicated as early as possible."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-semibold text-white","children":"6. Waiting Time"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm","children":"For advance bookings, the driver waits up to 15 minutes after the agreed pickup time. For airport pickups, we wait for the actual arrival time of the flight (flight monitoring). Longer waiting times may be charged additionally."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-semibold text-white","children":"7. Luggage"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm","children":"Normal travel luggage is included in the fare. Bulky or unusually large luggage must be specified when booking. The Company reserves the right to refuse to transport items that could damage the vehicle."}]]}],"$L2","$L3","$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9"]}],"$La"]}]}],null,"$Lb"]}],"loading":null,"isPartial":false}
